[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5880338404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123945#issuecomment-5880338404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123945","id":5880338404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXn7X5A","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T23:07:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T23:07:07Z","body":"Very likely that this is the cause, Steam is one of the few runtimes that actually keeps application based bindings and lets users override them. So it's likely the name is used when storing this.\r\n\r\nIn the same breath, when exporting to Steam Frame you need to be careful with spaces in the program name. And as everyone working on Linux knows, filenames become case sensitive so you have to be careful with putting paths.\r\n\r\nIn the end, some of this I think can only be fixed by documentation and experience.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5880338404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5888928814","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123945#issuecomment-5888928814","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123945","id":5888928814,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXwHsLg","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T11:02:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T11:02:41Z","body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\n> I wonder if we should clean up the name more, there are other reserved characters that can throw off path names.\r\n> \r\n> Also have a feeling that Steam may not be the only platform that suffers from this, but I have no evidence, just a feeling :)\r\n\r\nI think we'll have to fix these as they come up, because there's no way to know if a character causes problems without testing. I suppose we could try a mess of \"weirder\" characters and see what happens? But it's also probably best not to go overboard because SteamVR (or which ever runtime has an issue) could fix the bug at any time, and then we'd be mangling names for no reason\r\n\r\nI can say that Meta's, Pico's and AndroidXR's runtimes don't have a problem with slashes at least, because they all worked in my testing","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5888928814/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5896898299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123945#issuecomment-5896898299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123945","id":5896898299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABX3uG-w","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-29T19:12:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T19:12:00Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5896898299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5989529450","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123945#issuecomment-5989529450","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123945","id":5989529450,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZQD3ag","user":{"login":"DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T06:47:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T06:47:22Z","body":"I think I also hit this one back when i made \"Who's a good boy\" with the apostrophe in it, so there might still be some more fixes required for other punctuation as well?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5989529450/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5994679469","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123945#issuecomment-5994679469","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123945","id":5994679469,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZU-MrQ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T12:43:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T12:43:10Z","body":"Hm, an apostrophe is also a very common game name character - we should probably filter than one too\r\n\r\nOne more character is fine, but this is starting to make me wonder if we want to have a separate name setting for the OpenXR application name? Since this is taking the name from main game name, without having this special filtering, you end up having to change the name used everywhere on every platform. But if this ends up affecting a ton of characters, we may want the developer to be able to choose how they are filtered out (since in Steam VR, the name you give to OpenXR is the name shown to user when you press the system button and see the system menu)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5994679469/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6003532640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123945#issuecomment-6003532640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123945","id":6003532640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZdajYA","user":{"login":"DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T21:39:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T21:39:58Z","body":"I guess you could do it in export settings the same way as #71646 for consistency, though I do find it annoying having to set it for every export target individually","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6003532640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"